# Lost for Words (Windurst 2-1): a refusal. A level 10 Warrior of Windurst with 2-1 current at status 2 (a GM). Nanaa
# Mihgo of Windurst Woods plays 165; its finish with option 2 does nothing.
# Rival zone-in: entering Windurst Woods plays the Seekers of Adventure mission Rumors from the West, 839 (another
# mission's script, not this one); its finish writes that mission's status 4 (area 12).
lists WindurstWoods/Nanaa_Mihgo/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/165
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=65,-4,239 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=2
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Windurst LostForWords current
login
missionstatus Windurst 2                # a GM
trigger Nanaa_Mihgo+99                  # 165
finish option=2                         # refused: nothing
